B.aE5=new A.hC("0.1.127","Password fallback stays in sync","Signing in with email/password now verifies against your Casdoor password and keeps a local copy so login works even when the auth server is down.",B.EH)
B.aGb=new A.bg(61966,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.aE7=new A.hC("0.1.127","Feature update cards","After an app update, missed features show up in this overlay once. Skipping marks them as seen.",B.aGb)
B.aE6=new A.hC("0.1.129","Add to your Home Screen","Each app now has its own icon and, on phones, suggests adding it to your Home Screen \u2014 an app-like window plus storage the browser won\u2019t evict.",B.Ei)
B.aEb=new A.hC("0.1.143","Choose your language","Settings now has a Language row \u2014 switch the portal between English and \u7b80\u4f53\u4e2d\u6587, or follow your device default.",B.Ey)
B.aFQ=new A.bg(61204,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.aEa=new A.hC("0.1.158","A richer Activity calendar","Switch the calendar between 3 days, 1 week and 1 month, zoom the timeline with Ctrl/\u2318 + scroll, long-press-drag to create an event, and tap an event to see its details.",B.aFQ)
B.aGf=new A.bg(62390,"MaterialIcons",!0)
B.aE4=new A.hC("0.1.158","Browse and sort public notes","The Learner feed now shows public notes (even when signed out) with filters for scope, newest / oldest / most popular, and a time window.",B.aGf)
B.aGk=new A.bg(984351,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.aE9=new A.hC("0.1.162","A real month view","The 1-month calendar is now a month grid: each day shows its top events at a glance, with a +N overflow \u2014 tap a day to add an event, tap an event for details.",B.aGk)
B.aG1=new A.bg(61484,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.aE3=new A.hC("0.1.162","Plan without an account","You can now create activities while signed out or offline \u2014 they stay on this device and appear in the calendar and todo list next to your cloud events.",B.aG1)
B.aG_=new A.bg(61430,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.aE8=new A.hC("0.1.163","Drag to create events","On the 3-day and week calendar, drag down a day column to draw an event over the exact time span you want \u2014 just like Google Calendar.",B.aG_)
